# Wave W17-V (Heritage Forest): deep sand — canopy forest sand: a dim leaf-flecked sand running mouth to mouth under the manor oaks, its flecks fallen-leaf brown and shade green (design-authorised: the forest’s walking line, kept soft). Split from every open-road sand by the dimness itself — this sand has never seen full sun — and from the Ruined Path’s broken flags by kind entire (soft forest floor vs fallen road stone).
